  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="幽影林">
      <data key="d0">geo</data>
      <data key="d1">An ancient forest shrouded in mist named 'Yao Ying Lin', which is said to hide a secret that can only be uncovered by those with purity and courage.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="艾莉">
      <data key="d0">person</data>
      <data key="d1">A young girl with golden hair and bright blue eyes, known for her lively and brave personality, who inherits her father's courage and curiosity.&lt;SEP&gt;Aili embarks on a true adventure journey and overcomes various tests, eventually revealing the secrets of the ancient kingdom.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="艾莉的父亲">
      <data key="d0">person</data>
      <data key="d1">A renowned explorer who attempted to enter Yao Ying Lin in his youth but always returned without success, leaving an old backpack and some provisions for his daughter.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="小镇">
      <data key="d0">geo</data>
      <data key="d1">A small town on the edge of the forest, from where Aili sets out on her journey to uncover the secret of Yao Ying Lin.&lt;SEP&gt;The town is where Aili returns after her adventure, becoming a hero and continuing her journey from there.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="石碑">
      <data key="d0">event</data>
      <data key="d1">An ancient stone tablet with strange symbols that lead Aili to a hidden underground passage after it emits a soft glow.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="古老遗迹">
      <data key="d0">category</data>
      <data key="d1">An ancient site filled with ancient books, magical artifacts, and strange paintings of mythical creatures, indicating the historical significance of Yao Ying Lin.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="水晶球">
      <data key="d0">object</data>
      <data key="d1">A large crystal ball that shows a blurred figure and a wise elder, suggesting the presence of ancient wisdom and a guardian of the forest.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="森林的守护者">
      <data key="d0">person</data>
      <data key="d1">A wise elder who has been protecting the secret of Yao Ying Lin for centuries and gives Aili the task of finding a cursed lake and a crystal to dispel the mist.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="被诅咒的湖">
      <data key="d0">event</data>
      <data key="d1">A cursed lake in the forest that holds a crystal capable of dispelling the mist and revealing the forest's secret.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="考验">
      <data key="d0">event</data>
      <data key="d1">Three tests that Aili must pass to prove her courage, wisdom, and kindness in order to find the crystal and uncover the secret of Yao Ying Lin.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="迷雾">
      <data key="d0">category</data>
      <data key="d1">The fog is a mysterious phenomenon that surrounds the ancient kingdom and is dispelled by Aili using the crystal.&lt;SEP&gt;The mist that shrouds the ancient forest, creating an enigmatic atmosphere and making it difficult for adventurers to navigate.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="探险者">
      <data key="d0">person</data>
      <data key="d1">Adventurers who have ventured into the misty forest, many of whom have not returned, contributing to the legend of the forest.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="鸟鸣">
      <data key="d0">event</data>
      <data key="d1">The sound of birds chirping, one of the first sensory experiences Aili encounters upon entering the forest, indicating a natural setting.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="树叶的沙沙声">
      <data key="d0">event</data>
      <data key="d1">The rustling sound of leaves, another natural sound Aili hears upon entering the forest, adding to the immersive atmosphere.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="小兔子">
      <data key="d0">animal</data>
      <data key="d1">A small, fluffy rabbit that Aili encounters, seemingly unafraid and possibly leading her to clues about the forest.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="石阶">
      <data key="d0">object</data>
      <data key="d1">Stairs leading down to the underground passage discovered by Aili after the stone tablet emits a soft glow, suggesting an ancient structure.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="魔法道具">
      <data key="d0">category</data>
      <data key="d1">Magical artifacts found in the underground chamber, indicating the presence of ancient magic and rituals in Yao Ying Lin.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="奇怪的画像">
      <data key="d0">category</data>
      <data key="d1">Strange paintings depicting various mythical creatures, adding to the mystical and ancient feel of the underground chamber.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="山谷">
      <data key="d0">geo</data>
      <data key="d1">A valley Aili encounters on her journey, which includes a dangerous bridge over a fast-flowing river, a challenge she must overcome.&lt;SEP&gt;The valley is a location where Aili encounters a river and a dangerous bridge, representing her first challenge.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="荆棘">
      <data key="d0">category</data>
      <data key="d1">The thorny vines on the bridge are a physical obstacle Aili must navigate to cross the river.&lt;SEP&gt;Thorny bushes covering the bridge Aili must cross, representing a physical and symbolic obstacle in her quest.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="水晶">
      <data key="d0">object</data>
      <data key="d1">A crystal mentioned by the guardian of the forest as the key to dispelling the mist and revealing the secret of Yao Ying Lin.&lt;SEP&gt;The crystal is a magical artifact that Aili receives after helping the bird, representing a reward for her kindness and tests.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="诅咒">
      <data key="d0">category</data>
      <data key="d1">The curse placed on the lake, which makes it a dangerous and significant part of Aili's quest.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="守护者">
      <data key="d0">person</data>
      <data key="d1">The guardian is a character who reveals the beginning of the adventure and then disappears from the crystal ball.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="森林">
      <data key="d0">geo</data>
      <data key="d1">The forest is a location where Aili begins her adventure and encounters the first test.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="石桥">
      <data key="d0">geo</data>
      <data key="d1">The stone bridge is a challenging location in the valley that Aili must cross, featuring thorny vines and a giant spider.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="蜘蛛">
      <data key="d0">person</data>
      <data key="d1">The giant spider is a creature Aili encounters on the bridge, representing a test of courage.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="短剑">
      <data key="d0">technology</data>
      <data key="d1">The short sword is a weapon Aili uses to defeat the giant spider, representing her courage.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="花园">
      <data key="d0">geo</data>
      <data key="d1">The mysterious garden is a location where Aili encounters a riddle, representing a test of wisdom.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="花朵">
      <data key="d0">category</data>
      <data key="d1">The flowers in the garden are diverse and have different colors and shapes, representing a puzzle that Aili must solve.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="石门">
      <data key="d0">geo</data>
      <data key="d1">The hidden stone door is opened after Aili solves the riddle, representing a successful test of wisdom.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="湖边">
      <data key="d0">geo</data>
      <data key="d1">The lake's edge is a location where Aili encounters a wounded bird, representing a test of kindness.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="小鸟">
      <data key="d0">person</data>
      <data key="d1">The wounded bird is a character that tests Aili's kindness and rewards her with a crystal.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="古老王国">
      <data key="d0">geo</data>
      <data key="d1">The ancient kingdom is a hidden location in the forest that Aili reveals after dispelling the fog, representing the ultimate destination of her journey.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="地下室">
      <data key="d0">geo</data>
      <data key="d1">The basement is the starting point of Aili's adventure where she receives guidance from the guardian.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="湍急的河流">
      <data key="d0">geo</data>
      <data key="d1">The swift river is a natural feature in the valley where Aili encounters her first challenge.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="药草">
      <data key="d0">technology</data>
      <data key="d1">The herbs are a tool Aili uses to bandage the wounded bird, representing her kindness and resourcefulness.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="人们">
      <data key="d0">person</data>
      <data key="d1">The people of the town are characters who celebrate Aili's return and recognize her as a hero.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="冒险旅程">
      <data key="d0">event</data>
      <data key="d1">The adventure journey is the overarching narrative of Aili's story, filled with challenges and discoveries.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
    </node>
    <node id="未知和奇迹">
      <data key="d0">category</data>
      <data key="d1">The unknown and wonders represent the goals of Aili's journey, indicating her quest for new experiences and discoveries.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
    </node>
