    </edge>
    <edge source="水晶球" target="森林的守护者">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The wise elder in the crystal ball is the guardian of Yao Ying Lin, who provides Aili with guidance to find the crystal."|&gt;"guardian, guidance</data>
      <data key="d5">10</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="被诅咒的湖" target="考验">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The tests that Aili must pass are part of the journey to find the cursed lake, which is essential to uncovering the secret of Yao Ying Lin."|&gt;"challenge, quest</data>
      <data key="d5">9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="被诅咒的湖" target="水晶">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The crystal mentioned by the guardian is located in the cursed lake, which is crucial to Aili's quest."|&gt;"crystal, quest</data>
      <data key="d5">9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="被诅咒的湖" target="诅咒">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The curse on the lake makes it a significant and dangerous part of Aili's journey to uncover the secret of Yao Ying Lin."|&gt;"curse, significant</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="迷雾" target="探险者">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The mist in the forest is a challenge for the adventurers, making their journey difficult and contributing to the legend."|&gt;"challenge, legend</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="山谷" target="荆棘">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The thorny bushes on the bridge over the river in the valley are a physical obstacle for Aili to overcome."|&gt;"obstacle, valley</data>
